  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First 1000 Days Phase 2 (2022 &#x2013; 2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity builds on and augments the gains of First 1000 Days Phase 1, in improving child and newborn nutrition and care, and has an increased focus on improving routine immunisation rates. The Activity prioritises delivery in the Solomon Islands, Kiribati and Vanuatu and also includes a component of wider support to the region to combat vaccine preventable disease outbreaks.</narrative>
  </description>
